{"theory":{"blocks":[{"btype":"text","text":"جمل أطول ومفردات أقلّ شيوعًا. الكلمات الجديدة في معظمها مشروحة أدناه."},{"btype":"example","text":"Do you think Mary really wanted to do that by herself?","note":"هل تعتقد بان ماري تريد ان تفعل هذا بنفسها"},{"btype":"example","text":"Skura will win.","note":"ستفوز سكورا."},{"btype":"example","text":"How did you win?","note":"كيف فزت؟"},{"btype":"example","text":"Yanni didn't win.","note":"لم يفز ياني."},{"btype":"example","text":"Sami wanted to win.","note":"أراد سامي أن يفوز."},{"btype":"example","text":"You will never win.","note":"لن تفوز أبدا."},{"btype":"example","text":"How much did you win?","note":"كم رَبِحتَ؟"},{"btype":"example","text":"Tom isn't going to win.","note":"لن يفوز توم."},{"btype":"example","text":"Bill will win, won't he?","note":"سيفوز بيل، أليس كذلك؟"},{"btype":"example","text":"Ziri will win this time.","note":"سيفوز زيري هذه المرة"},{"btype":"example","text":"Yanni won't win this time.","note":"لن يفوز ياني هذه المرة."},{"btype":"example","text":"Layla wanted to win Sami back.","note":"أرادت ليلى أن تجعل سامي يحبّها مجدّدا."}]},"practice":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.translate","count":6,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.reverse","count":3,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.cloze","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"quiz":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.translate","count":4,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.reverse","count":3,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.build","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"review":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.dictation","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"data":{"lang":"en","lang_name":"الإنجليزية","sentences":[{"t":"Do you think Mary really wanted to do that by herself?","ar":"هل تعتقد بان ماري تريد ان تفعل هذا بنفسها"},{"t":"Skura will win.","ar":"ستفوز سكورا."},{"t":"How did you win?","ar":"كيف فزت؟"},{"t":"Yanni didn't win.","ar":"لم يف